## Reminder Email (send 14d after announcement if no referrals yet)

**Subject:** You have ${{ potential_earnings }} waiting to be claimed

Body:
Hey {{ first_name }},

You haven't shared your referral link yet — and your friends are missing out on $20 off.

Share your link: {{ referral_link }}

- You give: $20 off their first purchase
- You get: $20 credit
- No limits

{{ share_now }}

P.S. This month's top referrer has earned $300. Could be you!
